#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Removed    | Alternative\n"
"-----------|------------\n"
"`qiskit.transpiler.synthesis.aqc` (except for [`AQCSynthesisPlugin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.aqc_plugin.AQCSynthesisPlugin)) | [`qiskit.synthesis.unitary.aqc`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.unitary.aqc)\n"
"`qiskit.transpiler.synthesis.graysynth` | [`qiskit.synthesis.synth_cnot_phase_aam`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/synthesis#synth_cnot_phase_aam)\n"
"`qiskit.transpiler.synthesis.cnot_synth` | [`qiskit.synthesis.synth_cnot_count_full_pmh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/synthesis#synth_cnot_count_full_pmh)\n"
msgstr ""
"削除済み    | 代替手段\n"
"-----------|------------\n"
"`qiskit.transpiler.synthesis.aqc`（[`AQCSynthesisPlugin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.aqc_plugin.AQCSynthesisPlugin) を除く） | [`qiskit.synthesis.unitary.aqc`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.unitary.aqc)\n"
"`qiskit.transpiler.synthesis.graysynth` | [`qiskit.synthesis.synth_cnot_phase_aam`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/synthesis#synth_cnot_phase_aam)\n"
"`qiskit.transpiler.synthesis.cnot_synth` | [`qiskit.synthesis.synth_cnot_count_full_pmh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/synthesis#synth_cnot_count_full_pmh)\n"

